<title>Evaluation of suspected transverse myelitis (TM)</title>
<graphic href="eee0416-w0001.gif" />
<cell type="start" id="cell-1">
<label>Myelopathy?</label>
<path target="cell-4">No</path>
<path target="cell-2">Yes</path>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-2">
<label>MRI of the spine at the level of injury to rule out compression.</label>
<path target="cell-5">Compression present</path>
<path target="cell-3">No compression</path>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-3">
<label>Lumbar puncture.</label>
<path target="cell-6">Infection present</path>
<path target="cell-7">No infection, no evidence of connective tissue disease or hematologic malignancy</path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-4">
<label>Not TM.</label>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-5">
<label>Not TM; consult neurology and neurosurgery.</label>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-6">
<label>Not TM.</label>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-7">
<label>TM possible; consult neurology if not done.</label>
</cell>
